00:33:45.760 --> 00:33:47.650
and Storage integrations.

00:33:47.650 --> 00:33:50.800
We saw integrations
from large partners

00:33:50.800 --> 00:33:53.470
as well as from
independent developers.

00:33:53.470 --> 00:33:57.910
And we walked through use cases
that spanned design, legal,

00:33:57.910 --> 00:33:58.950
