I want to thank all our
partners for working

00:34:04.560 --> 00:34:08.400
with us to integrate Google
Docs more seamlessly into users

00:34:08.400 --> 00:34:09.929
workflows.

00:34:09.929 --> 00:34:13.170
And a special thanks to Ronen
and Marshall for walking us

00:34:13.170 --> 00:34:14.099
through some examples.

